    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d763">

                <pb facs="0870" n="750" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg750"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to Ambassador Meyer.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-07-19"><hi rendition="#italic">July 19,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Referring to your cablegram of 18th, has Russian Government brought or will it
                    bring <hi rendition="#italic">Oldhamia</hi> case before prize court?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
